# SfxLab family v2: layer id name type dur seed key=value... (dur 0 = endless) · range id param lo hi [note] · bind signal id|* param [lo hi] [rel] [steps=N | scale=<chord>] · note text · then `spell <id>` sections: name, recipe, the spell's layers at their lock values, its binds and notes
bench 1
root 65.4064
# voltaic: a blade's hum with sparks on it. Doubled, low-passed saws carry the bed and the notes (the beat between them slows as the
# ratios lock), the pen swings the hum like a moving blade, and the arc primitive is kept for accents: sparks, a sputter, the one-shots.
