range hum level 0.11 0.15 the blade's idle hum: two saws an octave apart at C2 and C3, each doubled a few cents off (the slow throb), low-passed near 500 Hz, a slow phaser
range hum pitch -9 -8.3 the swing: the pen's speed bends the hum up to 0.7 st, as a moving blade does
range hum cutoff 0.42 0.62 and opens its filter
range root level 0 0.15 C3 with its octave: doubled saws, low-passed
range root detune 0.15 1 the beat between the doubled saws: fast and restless at coherence 0, a slow throb at 1
range root shimmer 0 0.4 pitch wander while the reach is wrong (fit)
range root flange_pos 0 1 the comb, parked by the orb's curl (mix fixed at 0.3)
range third level 0 0.13 E3
range fifth level 0 0.13 G3
range seventh level 0 0.1 Bb3
range buzz level 0 0.25 the tube buzz: a periodic arc at C3, mostly ring, through a bandpass: in with stir
range sparks level 0.3 1 single sparks (an arc six octaves down): they fly while the ratios are off and settle as they lock
range crackle level 0 0.4 a sputtering arc: the pen's acceleration
range cloud level 0 0.3 a soft chord at C4, growing with the machine; spells raise it and pick the chord
range cloud voices 4 8
range cloud gather 0.5 1
bind stir hum level 0.15 0.11
bind orb.speed hum pitch 0 0.7 rel
bind orb.speed hum cutoff 0.42 0.62
bind orb.curl hum ph_pos 0 1
bind tone.root root level 0 0.15
bind tone.third third level 0 0.13
bind tone.fifth fifth level 0 0.13
bind tone.seventh seventh level 0 0.1
bind coherence root detune 1 0.15
bind coherence third detune 1 0.15
bind coherence fifth detune 1 0.15
bind coherence seventh detune 1 0.15
bind fit root shimmer 0.4 0
bind fit third shimmer 0.4 0
bind fit fifth shimmer 0.4 0
bind fit seventh shimmer 0.4 0
bind orb.radius root cutoff 0.5 0.75
bind orb.radius third cutoff 0.5 0.75
bind orb.radius fifth cutoff 0.5 0.75
bind orb.radius seventh cutoff 0.5 0.75
bind orb.curl root flange_pos 0 1
bind orb.curl third flange_pos 0 1
bind orb.curl fifth flange_pos 0 1
bind orb.curl seventh flange_pos 0 1
bind stir buzz level 0 0.25
bind orb.radius buzz cutoff 0.65 0.85
bind coherence sparks level 1 0.3
bind orb.accel crackle level 0 0.4
bind stack cloud level 0 0.3
bind coherence cloud gather 0.5 1
bind stack cloud voices 4 8
bind hand.fit buzz level 0 0.2 rel
note voltaic v2 (2026-10-03): the bulk is a lightsaber-style hum, the arcs are accents. (v1 was saw tones behind random gates with sine sparkle: too digital; an all-arc version was faithful and tiring. Both are in git history.)
note The hum recipe: saw oscillators doubled a few cents apart (their slow beat is the throb), low-passed around 500-900 Hz, with a
note parked comb or phaser for the phasey colour; movement is a pitch bend and a filter opening (the film sound was a hum re-recorded by a moving microphone).
note alive = the hum at C2+C3; notes = four doubled saws at C3 E3 G3 Bb3 with their octaves (tone.*), low-passed, combed;
note in tune = the beating slows (detune 1 -> 0.15 with coherence) and the sparks settle (level 1 -> 0.3); fit steadies the pitch;
note orb = the swing: its speed bends the hum up and opens it, its radius opens the notes, its curl parks the combs, its acceleration sputters an arc.
note Arcs are only accents here: the sparks, the crackle, the tube buzz (a periodic arc, mostly ring), and the lock / accept one-shots.
note Spells are placeholders.
note Reach hint: hand.fit (the reach of the component in hand against the recipe the stations point to) adds a little to one layer when it is right, and nothing otherwise; fit steadies the voices.
note Recipes are the sigil generator's (seed 1, 2026-10-03). Spell notes that name ratios or chord tones describe the earlier, hand-made recipes.

